---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';

const renderTime = new Date().toISOString();
---

<DocsLayout title="Installation">
  <h1>Installation</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Set up the NeuralFlow SDK in your project</p>

  <h2>Node.js / JavaScript</h2>
  <p>Install the NeuralFlow SDK using your preferred package manager:</p>

  <pre><code id="installation-js-command">npm install @neuralflow/sdk</code></pre>

  <p>Or with yarn:</p>

  <pre><code id="installation-yarn-command">yarn add @neuralflow/sdk</code></pre>

  <h3>Basic Setup</h3>
  <p>Initialize the client with your API key:</p>

  <pre><code id="installation-js-example">import {'{'} NeuralFlow {'}'} from '@neuralflow/sdk';

const client = new NeuralFlow({'{'}
  apiKey: process.env.NEURALFLOW_API_KEY,
{'}'});</code></pre>

  <h2>Python</h2>
  <p>Install with pip:</p>

  <pre><code>pip install neuralflow</code></pre>

  <h3>Basic Setup</h3>

  <pre><code id="installation-python-example">from neuralflow import NeuralFlow

client = NeuralFlow(api_key=os.environ['NEURALFLOW_API_KEY'])</code></pre>

  <h2>Environment Variables</h2>
  <p>We recommend storing your API key in an environment variable:</p>

  <pre><code id="installation-env-example"># .env
NEURALFLOW_API_KEY=your_api_key_here</code></pre>

  <div class="callout">
    <p><strong>Security Note:</strong> Never commit your API key to version control. Always use environment variables.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Next Steps</h2>
  <p>
    Now that you have the SDK installed, follow the <a href="/docs/quickstart">Quick Start</a> guide
    to process your first document.
  </p>

  <div class="render-info">
    Server-rendered at: {renderTime}
  </div>
  <script is:inline>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      const installationTargets = [
        { id: 'installation-js-command', interaction_type: 'javascript_command' },
        { id: 'installation-yarn-command', interaction_type: 'yarn_command' },
        { id: 'installation-js-example', interaction_type: 'javascript_example' },
        { id: 'installation-python-example', interaction_type: 'python_example' },
        { id: 'installation-env-example', interaction_type: 'env_example' }
      ];

      installationTargets.forEach(({ id, interaction_type }) => {
        document.getElementById(id)?.addEventListener('click', () => {
          window.posthog?.capture('installation_example_engaged', {
            interaction_type,
            page: '/docs/installation'
          });
        });
      });
    });
  </script>
</DocsLayout>
